1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:05,660
4,500 years ago, this city had a drainage
system that would surprise you even today.

2
00:00:05,940 --> 00:00:07,190
This is Mohenjo-daro,

3
00:00:07,240 --> 00:00:10,410
one of the greatest cities of the
ancient Indus Valley Civilisation.

4
00:00:10,690 --> 00:00:12,020
Look closely at its streets.

5
00:00:12,260 --> 00:00:14,190
The city had carefully planned streets,

6
00:00:14,220 --> 00:00:18,590
houses connected to drainage systems and
covered drains running alongside roads.

7
00:00:18,940 --> 00:00:21,030
Many houses even had bathing areas.

8
00:00:21,290 --> 00:00:22,780
This wasn't a random settlement.

9
00:00:22,880 --> 00:00:26,320
It was a carefully organised urban
civilisation that existed thousands of

10
00:00:26,320 --> 00:00:26,990
years ago.

11
00:00:27,180 --> 00:00:29,930
And much of its engineering
is still being studied today.

12
00:00:29,960 --> 00:00:32,530
How advanced do you think
this civilisation really was?

